/*@meta

Author:
'Sound Dust'

Description:
'radio broadcast from the last person on earth'

Usage:
'MW something else coming through\r\nAT too much static'

Categories:
'FX:Beeps & Bloops, FX:Glitch & Weird, FX:Noise & Rumble, FX:Rhythmic'

